OL,3,GNEWSATribute to 'loving dad' killed in 
OL,4,AM18 horse crash                        
OL,6,FThe family of a "loving and hands-on   
OL,7,Ffather" killed after his car hit a     
OL,8,Fhorse on the M18 have paid tribute to  
OL,9,Fhim.                                   
OL,11,FJohnny Brown, 50, suffered fatal       
OL,12,Finjuries after his grey Skoda Superb   
OL,13,Fcollided with a horse running loose on 
OL,14,Fthe carriageway at junction four, near 
OL,15,FDoncaster, at around 04:45 GMT on 13   
OL,16,FNovember.                              
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
