OL,3,GNEWSATribute to 'loving dad' killed in 
OL,4,AM18 horse crash                        
OL,6,FSouth Yorkshire Police said two        
OL,7,Fcollisions occurred at the junction    
OL,8,F"involving two loose horses". Both     
OL,9,Fhorses died and Johnny, a train driver 
OL,10,Ffrom Epworth, was pronounced dead at   
OL,11,Fthe scene.                             
OL,13,FIn a statement, his family said he had 
OL,14,Fa "remarkable gift for connecting with 
OL,15,Fpeople", and they were "devastated" by 
OL,16,Fhis death.                             
